                    "Text": "top of page\n[\n][1]\n* [\n  \n  ABOUT\n  \n  ][2]\n  * [Art Gallery][3]\n  * [Akademia Space][4]\n  * [Food Market][5]\n  * [Artisan Alley][6]\n* [\n  \n  PROGRAMME\n  \n  ][7]\n  * [Rage Stage][8]\n  * [Kodama Stage][9]\n  * [Tortuga Stage][10]\n  * [Visual Mapping][11]\n* [\n  \n  TICKETS\n  \n  ][12]\n  * [Ambassadors][13]\n* [\n  \n  LOCATION\n  \n  ][14]\n* [\n  \n  CONTACT/FAQ\n  \n  ][15]\n  * [Applications][16]\n  * [Imprint][17]\n  * [Privacy policy][18]\n* More\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items. [TICKETS][19]\n[bacgrkoiund_Kodama_edited. png]\n\n##### PROGRAMME\n\n##### STAGES, LINEUPS & VISUAL ARTIST TEAM\n\n[Superficie astratta]\nMAINSTAGE\n\n##### FURY & GLORY:\n##### RAGE STAGE\n\nThe Rage Stage is a haven of psychedelic music across the spectrum of all things fast and pumping. Hi-tech, Darkpsy, Experimental and Psycore merge into an international line-up of the superlative; 160 hours of pure eargasm, while otherworldly projection mapping is playing your synapses like a Piano. For fans of experimental music, this is a must!\n\n[bacgrkoiund_Rage_Onlycolor. jpg]\n\n##### RAGE STAGE\n##### \n##### 2025 LINEUP\n#####  \n\n[rage correct. jpg]\n[bacgrkoiund_Kodama_Onlycolor. jpg]\n\n##### \n##### KODAMA STAGE\n##### \n##### FOREST\n#####  \n##### 2025 LINEUP\n#####  \n\n[KODAMA-STAGE-(FOREST). jpg]\n[Sfundello_verde. jpg]\n[AWP_2237. jpg]\n\n##### DEEP & TWISTED:\n##### KODAMA STAGE\n\nThe Kodama stage, presented by the Viennese psychedelic and forest party collective of the same name, offers an enchanting environment featuring a diverse range of pumping and tribal electronic underground music. This year, our partners and friends will be curating the alternative showcase, enriching the forest and psychedelic lineup with a legendary selection of Tek and Techno tunes and performances. [AWP_2237. jpg]\n[DARKATP. jpg]\n\n##### KODAMA STAGE\n##### \n##### TEKNO\n##### \n##### 2025 LINEUP\n##### \n#####  \n\n[kodama tek correkt. jpg]\n[IMG_3363. JPG]\n\n##### \n##### LUNÁTICA STAGE BY CIRCUS BRUT\n##### \n##### 2025 LINEUP\n#####  \n\n[LUNATICA STAGE (3). jpg]\n[Superficie astratta]\nVISUAL MAPPING\n[Market-03. jpg]\n\n## VISUAL MAPPING\n\n[Videomapping software in use to create a live 3-D videomapping and pyrotechnic show by Spektrum visuals]\n\nIMMERSIVE VISUAL MAPPING by SPEKTRUM COLLECTIVE, made up of LightwaveZERO, Spirit Society, and Lumalux, will bring our stages to life with 3D projection mapping and live visuals. Spektrum is known for creating mesmerizing psychedelic experiences, and for 2025, they have taken their craft to new heights. Since 2024 Projekt Gamma, featuring Ido Herzmann, Rotem Mor, and Yohai Sudri joined the visual team. This trio will unleash their unique screenings, pushing the boundaries of visual mapping. Their visionary display will fuse with the unique designs of the Rage, Kodama, and Tortuga Stages, incorporating Tekno and Psytrance vibes in a captivating, dystopian, mechanical atmosphere. These visual and sonic elements will transport you to otherworldly realms. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind\n\n3D mapping spectacle at Masters of Puppets 2025. [AWE_9976_edited. jpg]\n\n# [ABOUT][20]\n\n[Location 07. jpg]\n\n# [TICKETS][21]\n\n[3. LOCATION. jpg]\n\n# [LOCATION][22]\n\n[4. APPLICATIONS. jpg]\n\n# [ APPLICATIONS][23]\n\n## OUR PARTNERS\n\nTo play, press and hold the enter key. To stop, release the enter key. * [][24]\n* [][25]\n* [][26]\n* [][27]\n* [][28]\n\n© 2024 by Masters of Puppets Festival\n\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\n\n## Menu\n\n[About][29]\n\n[Programme][30]\n\n[Tickets][31]\n\n[Location][32]\n\n[Applications][33]\n\n## Socials\n\n[Instagram][34]\n\n[Facebook][35]\n\n[Youtube][36]\n\n[Imprint][37]\n\n\n\nCONTACT\n\n[FAQ][38]\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www. net/copia-di-infos\n[3]: https://www. mastersofpuppets. net/copia-di-infos\n[4]: https://www. mastersofpuppets. net/copia-di-infos\n[5]: https://www. mastersofpuppets. net/copia