Zion Gate\n\n*Last updated: April 24, 2026*\n\n## 🎶 About the Festival\n\nThe third edition of the internationally acclaimed Masters of Puppets Brazil (M. O. P. Brasil) is coming to Lagoinha, São Paulo. A true feast for lovers of raw rhythms – a fusion of dark, hitech, experimental, and psytrance sounds. Born in Europe, Masters of Puppets traces its roots to Hungarian underground psy culture of the late 2000s. When Hungarian pioneers joined forces with Czech producers, the first major European edition came to life. Brazil got its own edition in 2019, carrying the same vision. Subcultural festival that offers freedom, self-expression, and exploration of the psychedelic experience. What makes Masters of Puppets Brazil so unique? The music runs wild – up to 200 BPM! You can surrender to the flow, dance ecstatically, silence the mind, and let your body lead. On the other hand, you might enjoy a soothing massage or join an inspiring art workshop. Though it may sound unusual for an uptempo festival like M. O. P. , you can even attend a talk by a special guest. We’d be lying if we said M. O. P. is about harmony – it’s rhythmic, wild, and primal energy in its purest form."
